there was an error during a transformation.Associates an Import Set record with a specific GlideImportSetTransformer object.Associates an Import Set Run object with a specific GlideImportSetTransformer object.Associates a GlideImportLog object with a specific GlideImportSetTransformer object.Associates a Transform Map with a specific GlideImportSetTransformer object.Enables running synchronous transformations.Executes the Import Set transformation.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/GlideImportSetTransformerAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":4,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[35,38],[65,67],[81,90],[128,142],[151,165],[175,191],[201,215],[225,265],[275,322]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/GlideImportSetTransformerAPI.md"},
